{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>I have cut</b> — behold, he mentioned at the beginning that before the covenant, HaShem's word was חסד, and after the covenant, אמונה." "And the commentators who explain עולם חסד יבנה as 'the world was built by חסד' — this is not the meaning of this psalm. Furthermore: every עולם in all of Scripture is time."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 89, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:36:24.799549686Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}